# The Narrenschiff

id:world-the-narrenschiff a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "The Narrenschiff" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/534fee3bba72a> ;
    oa:kind "habitat" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "A ship that became a habitat, at Epsilon Microscopii — 169 ly out against the article's 182. The Fomalhaut Acquisition Society built the ship, which is why they are recorded here, but built is not held and the holding is marked uncertain." ;
    oa:uncertain true .

